Design a circuit that counts the number of set bits (1s) in a 16-bit input value. The module takes a 16-bit input and produces a 4-bit output representing the total count of bits that are set to one. This functionality is useful for applications requiring bitwise analysis, such as in digital signal processing or data compression algorithms.
